---
source: tests/ui.rs
expression: "run_ouch(\"ouch decompress archive.tgz\", dir)"
---
[ERROR] Could not extract archive
 - The decompressed data is still gzip-compressed instead of being a tar archive
 - This usually means the file was compressed one more time than its extension suggests

hint: Rename the file to include the missing compression extension, or decompress the extra layer manually before extracting it
